  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large saucepan, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and sauté until softened.",
    "Add the artichoke hearts, roasted red peppers, chickpeas, tomato paste, and spices.",
    "Stir to combine and cook for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the paella rice and warm water to the saucepan.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and cover.",
    "Transfer the saucepan to the preheated oven and bake for 25-30 minutes.",
    "Remove from oven and let rest for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
